Sound design in this directory is original synthesis (numpy). No third-party
recording, sample, or melody is included.

bed.wav    A two-note pad plus filtered noise, written by bed_audio.synthesize_bed.
           Integrated loudness is about -22 LUFS before the voice ducks it.
whoosh.wav Filtered-noise scene sweep, written by sfx.whoosh.
click.wav  A short UI tick, written by sfx.click.

All three are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
